# CRM7 Dockerless VPS — Apache main-server directives.
# Merge these two lines into the MAIN server context of httpd.conf
# (Debian/Ubuntu: /etc/apache2/apache2.conf), OUTSIDE any <VirtualHost>.
# They MUST NOT be placed inside deploy/dockerless/apache-root.conf:
# apachectl configtest rejects them there.
ServerTokens Prod
ServerSignature Off

# Required modules must also be enabled by the target distribution's mechanism
# (for example `a2enmod alias rewrite proxy proxy_fcgi authz_core unixd dir
# mime log_config headers setenvif` on Debian/Ubuntu). Do not copy module paths
# from the disposable Alpine test image.
